<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables - Shelby Williams.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables - Shelby Williams.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Friday that Shelby Williams Industries Inc and USF&amp;G Corp preferred A stock were unavailable for after-hours trading for news.  </p>
<p>Shelby Williams said it expected 1996 earnings per share to exceed median analyst estimates of $0.26 a share for the fourth quarter and $0.94 for the full year.</p>
<p>USF&amp;G said it will redeem 50 percent of its $4.10 Series A convertible preferred shares.</p>
<p>Corimon SACA, Westmoreland Coal Co and Westmoreland preferred A stock were also unavailable for trading.</p>
